    "Id": "chassisdef_longbow_LGB-14V",
    "Name": "Longbow",
    "Details": "The latest model based on the Longbow chassis, the -14V mounts two Apollo MRM 20 and two LRM-5 launchers, combined with two Light PPC and two ER Medium Lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Anti-Air Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
